      "cooked": "<p>The intent of Unload seems to be that during the character's power phase, expatriate can keep playing powers until they have activated n powers.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>how does this power work if it is activated during a different character's turn? Do both players get to activate powers during the power phase? Timing and ordering?</p><p>how does it work if activated during the villain or environment turn, which does not have a play a power phase?</p>",
